            <footer>Snapshot for Sales Rep; &quot; - &quot; indicates users who have never logged in. Goals: Weekly (Q3 70%, &apos;15 75%), Monthly (Q3 90%, &apos;15 90%). Days measures from date of snapshot.</footer>
